+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+## Voyage 1: TodoMVC app build
+
+- Stack: vanilla JavaScript, Node.js runtime, npm. Testing with Cucumber + happy-dom.
+- Spec authored from `assets/app-spec.md`. Template base at `assets/app-template.index.html`.
+- Four feature files cover: management, editing, filtering, persistence.
+- No preprocessors. Vanilla JS only. localStorage persistence key pattern `todos-[framework]`.
+- `features/support/` will need a happy-dom world setup and step definitions (QM role).
+- `js/app.js` will be the main application entry point (Crew role).
+- Watchbill covers all four features. First voyage: produce production code and step definitions.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- No routing library needed: vanilla hashchange event for `#/`, `#/active`, `#/completed`.
+- No build step. No TypeScript. No CSS preprocessors.
+- Todo model: `{ id: string, title: string, completed: boolean }`.
+- Persistence key: `todos-javascript` per spec convention.
+- Editing mode not persisted.
\ No newline at end of file
