@@ -0,0 +1,69 @@
+@logic
+Feature: Todo Editing
+  As a user
+  I want to edit existing todos
+  So that I can correct or update my tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded fresh
+
+  Scenario: User enters editing mode by double-clicking the label
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the user double-clicks the label of "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "editing"
+    And the edit input for "Buy milk" is focused
+    And the edit input contains "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: User saves the edit by pressing Enter
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the user double-clicks the label of "Buy milk"
+    And the user changes the edit value to "Buy organic milk" and presses Enter
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" does not exist
+    And the todo "Buy organic milk" appears in the list
+    And the todo "Buy organic milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: User saves the edit by blurring the input
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the user double-clicks the label of "Buy milk"
+    And the user changes the edit value to "Buy organic milk" and blurs the input
+    Then the todo "Buy organic milk" appears in the list
+    And the todo "Buy organic milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: User cancels edit by pressing Escape
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the user double-clicks the label of "Buy milk"
+    And the user changes the edit value to "Buy organic milk" and presses Escape
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" appears in the list with title "Buy milk"
+    And the todo "Buy milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: User destroys todo by clearing the edit value and pressing Enter
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the user double-clicks the label of "Buy milk"
+    And the user changes the edit value to "" and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: User destroys todo by clearing the edit value and blurring
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the user double-clicks the label of "Buy milk"
+    And the user changes the edit value to "" and blurs the input
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: User trims whitespace in edited title
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the user double-clicks the label of "Buy milk"
+    And the user changes the edit value to "   Buy organic milk   " and presses Enter
+    Then the todo "Buy organic milk" appears in the list
\ No newline at end of file
