diff --git a/features/todo-persistence.feature b/features/todo-persistence.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4c1a080
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-persistence.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,62 @@
+@logic
+Feature: Todo Persistence
+  As a user
+  I want my todos to be saved across page reloads
+  So that I do not lose my tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded fresh
+
+  Scenario: Todos persist across page reload
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+      | Learn JS |
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+    And the todo "Learn JS" appears in the list
+    And the todo-count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Completed state persists across page reload
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    | completed |
+      | Buy milk | true      |
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Deleted todo is removed from persistence
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the user clicks the destroy button on "Buy milk"
+    And the app is reloaded
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Cleared completed todos are cleared from persistence
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title      | completed |
+      | Buy milk   | true      |
+      | Learn JS   | false     |
+    When the user clicks the "Clear completed" button
+    And the app is reloaded
+    Then the todo "Learn JS" appears in the list
+    And the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+
+  Scenario: New todos added after reload persist
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    |
+      | Buy milk |
+    When the app is reloaded
+    And the user types "Learn JS" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    And the app is reloaded again
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+    And the todo "Learn JS" appears in the list
+
+  @contract
+  Scenario: Stored data conforms to the expected schema
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title    | completed |
+      | Buy milk | false     |
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then localStorage contains a key matching "todos-*"
+    And the stored value is an array with an object having keys "id", "title", and "completed"
\ No newline at end of file
